# PrismSearch 环境变量模板 / Environment variable template
# 复制为 .env 后，取消需要的行的注释并填写；.env 已被 .gitignore 忽略，切勿提交真实密钥。
# Copy to .env, uncomment the lines you need and fill them in; .env is git-ignored — never commit real secrets.
#
# 所有变量都是可选的。不需要的变量请保持注释状态：PRISMSEARCH_SERVER_PORT= 这类「设置为空字符串」
# 的配置覆盖会被当成实际值参与校验并导致启动失败。
# Every variable is optional. Keep unused ones commented out: an override set to an empty string
# (e.g. PRISMSEARCH_SERVER_PORT=) counts as a value and fails validation.
#
# PrismSearch 本身不会自动读取 .env 文件，需要由 docker compose（--env-file）、进程管理器或 shell 加载。
# PrismSearch does not load .env by itself; let docker compose, your process manager or shell load it.

# ===== 配置与数据 / Config & data =====
# 配置文件路径（YAML/JSON/TOML） / Config file path
# PRISMSEARCH_CONFIG=
# 数据目录，默认 ~/.prismsearch（缓存库与用户配置） / Data dir, default ~/.prismsearch
# PRISMSEARCH_HOME=

# ===== 传输 / Transport =====
# stdio | http
# PRISMSEARCH_SERVER_TRANSPORT=
# HTTP 端口，默认 3000 / HTTP port, default 3000
# PRISMSEARCH_SERVER_PORT=
# HTTP 监听地址，默认 127.0.0.1；非回环地址必须开启鉴权 / Bind address; non-loopback requires auth
# PRISMSEARCH_SERVER_HOST=

# ===== 鉴权 / Auth =====
# 逗号分隔的访问令牌；非空即自动开启 HTTP 鉴权 / Comma-separated tokens; non-empty enables auth
# PRISMSEARCH_AUTH_TOKENS=
# 抓取 Worker 共享令牌（主服务与 Worker 两端一致） / Shared token for fetch workers
# PRISMSEARCH_WORKER_TOKEN=

# ===== 搜索 API Key / Search API keys =====
# 逗号分隔可配置多个，配额耗尽时自动轮换 / Comma-separated keys rotate on quota exhaustion
# GOOGLE_API_KEY=
# Google Programmable Search Engine ID (cx)
# GOOGLE_CSE_ID=
# BRAVE_API_KEY=

# ===== 日志 / Logging =====
# error | warn | info | debug
# PRISMSEARCH_LOG_LEVEL=

# ===== 其他配置项 / Any other option =====
# 任意配置项都可用 PRISMSEARCH_<路径> 覆盖，层级之间用双下划线；数组可写 JSON 或逗号分隔。
# Any option can be overridden with PRISMSEARCH_<PATH>, "__" between levels; arrays accept JSON or commas.
# PRISMSEARCH_CACHE__BACKEND=redis
# PRISMSEARCH_CACHE__REDIS__URL=redis://redis:6379
# PRISMSEARCH_ENGINES__DUCKDUCKGO__ENABLED=true
# PRISMSEARCH_SECURITY__RATE_LIMIT__MAX_REQUESTS=30
# PRISMSEARCH_SECURITY__SSRF__WHITELIST=["intranet.example.com"]
# PRISMSEARCH_FETCHER__BROWSER__ENABLED=true
